      "napPerc": 40,
      "expertCount": 0,
      "commentCount": 2,
      "comment": "Emerald Army remains unexposed despite a 3lb rise for winning after a break at this venue over 6 furlongs just 10 days ago. He had a very consistent and progressive autumn campaign over 7 furlongs, and the step back to this distance today is a positive. Zak Wheatley takes a further 3lb off his back and gets on very well with the horse, being the jockey who won on him in the autumn. A big run is expected, having already got this spring campaign off to a flying start."
